#: templates/landing/index.html:1089
msgid "The problem"
msgstr "Muammo"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1090
msgid "Do these problems sound familiar?"
msgstr "Bu muammolar sizga tanishmi?"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1091
msgid ""
"Most salons and clinics face these daily challenges. Every missed call is a "
"lost client."
msgstr ""
"Ko'pgina salonlar va klinikalar har kuni shu qiyinchiliklar bilan duch "
"keladi. Har bir javobsiz qo'ng'iroq — yo'qolgan mijoz."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1097
msgid "Non-stop phone calls"
msgstr "To'xtovsiz telefon qo'ng'iroqlari"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1098
msgid ""
"While serving a client, the phone rings again. If you don't answer, the "
"booking is lost. If you do, your work stops."
msgstr ""
"Mijozni qabul qilayotganda telefon yana jiringlaydi. Javob bermasangiz — "
"yozilish yo'qoladi. Javob bersangiz — ish to'xtaydi."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1104
msgid "Double bookings"
msgstr "Ikki marta yozilish"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1105
msgid ""
"Tracking appointments in a notebook or WhatsApp always leads to mistakes. "
"Two clients booked at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Qog'oz daftar yoki WhatsApp orqali yozilishlarni kuzatish — xato va "
"chalkashlik doim bor. Bir vaqtda ikki mijoz yoziladi."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1111
msgid "Clients who don't show up"
msgstr "Kelmagan mijozlar"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1112
msgid ""
"The client forgot, didn't come. You're left with empty time you can't "
"recover. No reminder was sent."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz unutdi, kelmadi. Siz esa bo'sh qoldingiz. Eslatma yuborilmagan edi."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1123
msgid "The solution"
msgstr "Yechim"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1124
msgid "Start in 3 simple steps"
msgstr "3 oddiy qadamda boshlang"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1125
msgid "From registration to your first online booking — under 15 minutes."
msgstr "Ro'yxatdan o'tishdan birinchi onlayn yozilishgacha — 15 daqiqadan kam."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1132
msgid "Create your business"
msgstr "Biznesingizni yarating"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1133
msgid ""
"Add your salon or clinic name, staff members, services and prices. All in "
"one place."
msgstr ""
"Salon yoki klinikangiz nomini, xodimlar, xizmatlar va narxlarni qo'shing. "
"Barchasi bir joyda."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1141
msgid "Share your link"
msgstr "Havolangizni ulashing"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1142
msgid ""
"Send your personal booking link to clients via Instagram, WhatsApp, or add "
"it to your profile bio."
msgstr ""
"Shaxsiy yozilish havolangizni Instagram, WhatsApp orqali yuboring yoki "
"bio'ga qo'shing."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1150
msgid "Receive bookings"
msgstr "Yozilishlarni qabul qiling"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1151
msgid ""
"Clients book themselves, you get a notification. SMS reminders are sent "
"automatically. No calls needed."
msgstr ""
"Mijozlar o'zlari yoziladi, siz bildirishnoma olasiz. SMS eslatmalar "
"avtomatik ketadi. Qo'ng'iroq kerak emas."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1163
msgid "Everything you need in one place"
msgstr "Hamma kerakli narsa bir joyda"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1164
msgid ""
"Built for real businesses in Uzbekistan. Nothing unnecessary, nothing "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"O'zbekistondagi haqiqiy bizneslar uchun qurilgan. Ortiqcha narsa yo'q, "
"yetishmaydigani ham yo'q."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1170
msgid "24/7 Online booking"
msgstr "24/7 Onlayn yozilish"

#: templates/landing/index.html:1171
msgid "Clients can book at midnight. You sleep — your business keeps working."
msgstr ""
"Mijozlar tun yarmida ham yozilishi mumkin. Siz uxlaysiz — biznes ishlaydi."

#: templates/landing/index.html:1177
